 ### Added
 
+- Queue and ticket persistence: `Queue` model with entity relationship and `Ticket` model with sequence code generation (`A001`, `A002`, …, `A1000`, …), priority support, immutability enforcement on issuance fields, and single-call semantics. `IssueTicket` action with queue-active validation (inside transaction with lock), retry logic for concurrent issuance, and rejection of negative priority. Enums for `TicketChannel` (totem, virtual, printed) and `TicketStatus` (waiting, called). `InactiveQueueException` for deactivated queues. Factories for both models with code allocation and `forQueue()` helper. Comprehensive Pest tests covering issuance, code generation (sequence, malformed legacy codes, overflow), immutability, authorization, and concurrency.
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
